{"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A set of conditions an entity must meet, beyond holding the components a query reads."}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/SQ","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/SH","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/queryfilter"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Filtering-Queries","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/FilterTerm","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/With","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Without","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Added","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Changed","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Allows"],"generated":true,"title":"Filtering Queries"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"QueryFilter"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryingAWorld"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A filter can require component types, exclude them, require components added or changed since","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a tick, and require a relation to a target. Filters read nothing: an entity’s components decide","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whether it passes, but a query’s rows carry only the values of its terms.","type":"text"}],"t